My train reaches the big junction station.
I remember that aunty's instructions.
The train's doors open.
I alight from the train.
This station is very big.
There is a lot of crowd here.
I need to get to the other platform.
I look up.
There are colored signboards there.
I see the blue sign.
I need to go by the blue line train.
I walk through a long corridor.
People are walking fast.
I reach the new platform.
I wait behind the yellow line.
In a few minutes, the new train arrives.
The train's doors open.
I board this train.
Now I am on the right route.
